+// looked through for what makes a moment special. The same search as the Studio's "Special moments found this day",
+// with the everyday words left out that a public page would call special by mistake (a shawl "honor", "Lord
+// Harikrishna Maharaj", a plain "celebration", the daily abhishek, arrivals, sabhas). Strongest first; a photo moment
+// opens that photo, a story moment its year below, a News story baps.org. Only photos with Bapa, as everywhere on Today.
